\newlabel{fig:ligolaserchapteroltfmeasurement}{{3.18}{73}{Sketch of the amplitude stabilisation servo. The open loop transfer function was measured by injecting a signal into a $\times 1$ adding stage and measuring the ratio of the signal immediately after and just before this stage. \relax }{figure.caption.96}{}}
